-- Hausdorff's paradox: the sphere minus the fixed points of the nontrivial
-- words is paradoxical under SO3, through a free action of the free group
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
